<title>USA: Tidewater to buy back $200 mln in shares.</title>
<headline>Tidewater to buy back $200 mln in shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tidewater Inc said Thursday its board approved a plan to spend $200 million to repurchase shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Tidewater, which owns and operates a fleet of 650 vessels serving the offshore energy industry, has about 62 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Tidewater's stock closed at 43-5/8, up 3/4, in trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
